{"title":"Hill Giant Brute","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (12.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 180 total, 32–102 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bodkin-bolt\" title=\"Bodkin Bolt - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a2e1626588f08ce161d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bodkin Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Hill Giant: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-adolescent\">Hill Giant Adolescent</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-king\">Hill Giant King</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/78441126ec6aaaf1de0c.svg\" alt=\"Hill Giant Brute\"></div><h3>Hill Giant Brute</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>27</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 28)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Hill Giant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,350</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>6.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2